1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Milky Delivery is a short but satisfying adventure game.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:09,000
You play as Neha, a young bike courier, travelling across beautiful landscapes.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Deliver milk to a bunch of friendly villagers.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Take care of your pet car milky and heal the community.

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Upgrade your bike to travel faster and farther to new destinations.

6
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Manage your resources and experiment with different flavors like strawberry or milk tea.

7
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:35,000
With each delivery, you learn more about the region, its people, and what happened to all the other cows.

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:42,000
The demo is now live on Steam, so if you want to support us, go check it out and wishlist the game.

9
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Merci!

